  },
  "section": "9.15",
  "rulesText": "A curse is a magical burden that lasts for a specified time or until it is ended by some means. A magical contagion is an adverse effect of magical origin that is contagious by definition.\n\nThe following sections discuss curses and magical contagions in detail."
}
